 "id": 1777724,
 "titulo": "12/6 Update Details",
 "fecha": 1670318395215,
 "modificada": 1732917892549,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1777724",
 "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1670301187939\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/260b0bbeb3e043e7bb0f1cdbd1ac0f47_1670301187939_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents!&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The theme of the December Update is the &lt;Destiny of X&gt;!<br>\nFind out what future the Mutants will face in MARVEL Future Fight!&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">First of all, check out the main heroes of the Update.<br>\nThe new Super Hero <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Polaris </span>as Tier-3,<br>\nTier-4 Advancement for the Dark Phoenix, <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Jean Grey</span>,&nbsp;<br>\na new Uniform for the leader of the Mutants, <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Cyclops</span>,<br>\nPotential Transcendence for <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Beast, Angel, and Bishop</span> who will stand together,<br>\nand six new <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Artifacts </span>for the updated heroes will be added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Fight against the <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">World Boss Legend: Dark Phoenix</span>&nbsp;<br>\nwho has burst her powers with the upgraded heroes.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">World Boss Conquer Effects, Purchase All Feature for some Store items,&nbsp;<br>\nand the 2022 Event Token Archive Reward</span> have been added&nbsp;<br>\nto help you prepare for the battles, so please check the details below.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ One New Hero</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Polaris, a powerful female Mutant&nbsp;<br>\nwho controls the magnetic force, has been added.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The hero skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">[12/7 (Wed) 2:38&nbsp;(UTC+0), 12/6 (Tue)&nbsp;18:38&nbsp;(PST)]</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">The acquisition method of Polaris has been informed wrongly in the notice has been fixed.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">After: Get 20 X-Genes Daily.</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1415\" id=\"1670379202837\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/36bda55f2c7d4c5c8c7441c6368aa488_1670379202837_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Four New Uniforms</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The Mutants have gained more power with the Uniforms to fight against their fate.&nbsp;<br>\nCheck out the abilities of Jean Grey &lt;Dark Phoenix&gt;, Cyclops &lt;Modern&gt;,&nbsp;<br>\nBeast &lt;All-New X-Men&gt;, and Angel &lt;All-New X-Men&gt;.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* New Uniform Skills are based on the following skill Level stats. (Tier-4 heroes: Lv. 10, Others: Lv. 6)<br>\n* The four new uniforms will be on sale for </span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">40% off during the &lt;December Update Celebration Event&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">,&nbsp;<br>\nand can be checked and purchased in the Marvel Universe and the Uniform Room after the event.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1690\" id=\"1670315648137\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/c4ceac62a5f249fab703a98204b6e12e_1670315648137_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1533\" id=\"1670306087091\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/e269d95a7d6e470d83d46e8e6e6142ed_1670306087091_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1405\" id=\"1670315864879\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/a62a68e3461c414099f5fbf3878a5e73_1670315864879_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1670378066001\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/530e2edea9614429898594b8f94c3ac8_1670378066001_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Polaris Tier-3</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Polaris has gained new powers to protect the peace of the Mutants.<br>\nThe trapped enemies will receive a powerful polarity attack.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"376\" id=\"1670306123040\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/ae5c57f4376640e18b99cabc0ba15514_1670306123040_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1670319841746\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/80104c5db36246c7a8441f210e8b37fd_1670319841746.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Jean Grey Tier-4</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Jean Grey, the physical manifestation of the Phoenix Force has gained new powers.<br>\nCheck out the powerful mental abilities of Jean Grey who can control great powers.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The Artifact Skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"302\" id=\"1670306134369\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/7b2d7b34b9654a8d8017b18af2f61fe3_1670306134369_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Potential Awakening &amp; Transcendence</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Through the December Update, Beast, Angel, and Bishop<br>\nwill be available for Potential Awakening &amp; Transcendence.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The Artifact Skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1184\" id=\"1670317528595\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/143dddfe23da4ca78c6820c5e8f378b0_1670317528595_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1670319860459\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/04ac292670da4b2783d89cc0f7336d74_1670319860459.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1670319860438\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/df400851b6324c6fa39cc77ef9f289f8_1670319860438.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1670319860478\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/7a61e9fb67d84c5d9575d8a266db5135_1670319860478.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ New World Boss Legend: Dark Phoenix &amp; Improvements in Conquer System</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The first Mutant World Boss Legend has been released!<br>\nPrepare for the outrage of the Dark Phoenix.<br>\n​<br>\n1. Dark Phoenix has been added as a World Boss Legend.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- The World Boss ranking for Dark Phoenix has been added.<br>\n- Challenges for Dark Phoenix have been added.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1670311736130\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/60f5649c29014f76bd1d838099d650f3_1670311736130_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. Agents can challenge Dark Phoenix from Difficulty 1 after clearing the unlock challenges.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1670301638169\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/7eca2901d0ec4745901e5022587964ec_1670301638169_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">3. Clear Dark Phoenix to acquire various rewards.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Various effects such as Potential Search Points and Conquer Level Points can be acquired.<br>\n- Cosmic Cube Fragments can be acquired at a 100% rate from World Boss: Legend difficulties.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1670301673751\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/df49cdbf95a84b7bb5fbf81f424df02f_1670301673751_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"894\" id=\"1670307876199\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/573a3bb4e3814e7c847d064216221b92_1670307876199_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">4. Conquer Effects have been added for Ultimate: Thanos &amp; all World Boss Legends.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">[Conquer Effects]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The &lt;basic damage increase&gt; effect that applies to each World Boss: Legend<br>\ncan be enhanced by raising the Conquer Level of the respective World Boss.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The target and conditions of the Conquer Effect of each World Boss are different.<br>\n* All Conquer Effects that apply to the same World Boss will be accumulated.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1670301731615\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/4e1ab54607af49b18b632831a341bfae_1670301731615_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">5. The Conquer Level of all World Boss has been expanded from 100 to 200.<br>\n- Rewards for Conquer Level 101 - 200 have been added.<br>\n- The resist effect will be increased based on the Conquer Level for all Ultimate Bosses.<br>\n- The basic damage dealt to specific Bosses will be increased&nbsp;<br>\nbased on the Conquer Level of Ultimate Mode: Thanos and all World Boss: Legends.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ 2022 Event Token Archive Reward</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We have prepared a reward for Agents who have participated in all the events this year.<br>\nCheck out the special record you have achieved and receive the reward!<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Acquire the Special Icon &lt;Luna’s Thank You Gift&gt;&nbsp;<br>\nby collecting all the event Tokens of 2022 including the events that are to be held.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1670301771695\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/f3b54a2572d341109f258d7ed62f04cb_1670301771695_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ New Artifacts</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">After the December Update, exclusive Passive Skill Artifacts will be added&nbsp;<br>\nfor Polaris, Jean Grey, Cyclops, Beast, Angel, and Bishop.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1593\" id=\"1670317758759\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/52f75ada7eea48108ad938f4877f704a_1670317758759_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ New Future Pass Season &amp; Special Icons</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A new season of Future Pass will begin after the update.<br>\nObtain various rewards and Special Icons with the Future Pass.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[Future Pass Rewards]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"573\" id=\"1670307863575\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/e653977ae7a6418da0150250047cc5ba_1670307863575_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Please note that the Future Pass effects&nbsp;will apply immediately upon purchase and cannot be refunded.<br>\n- Legendary / Mythic Future Pass that has been unlocked will only be applied during the season&nbsp;<br>\nthe Pass was purchased, and the Pass rewards will only be available during the same season.<br>\nPlease don’t forget to check the remaining event time.<br>\n- The Mythic Pass can be purchased after purchasing the Legendary Pass.<br>\n- Legendary and Mythic Future Passes will not be available for purchase&nbsp;<br>\nwhen the season is about to end. Please check the sale schedule in the game.</span><br>\n<br>\n​New Special Icons that will represent you have been added.<br>\nCollect two new icons as Future Pass Rewards,&nbsp;<br>\none as the World Boss: Legend Dark Phoenix reward,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">and two more from the Token Event that will be opened afterward&nbsp;and the 2022 Event Token Archive.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[December Update New Special Icons]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-ed1e148d-7fff-8152-34a7-e194f4a55eb7\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/y4FHdCLo0nc--4TeNgteLe8n0nnEDo-wJ9YwFcGbvtrd2jOPslnvxGLnT6QTE38hC8SlZ3g9YlCQJA353VBU1VLZqqxOq7_Ucz3nxxDwrzCit-IgxQ82lXoZqWCMRxkDYuBzVuhpf1QuAqr9_z6zNJrfkSpMGXliWzr6iBGvOk2Ii3v6rjrgseC8P7vtMg\" width=\"150\"></b><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<b id=\"docs-internal-guid-ed1e148d-7fff-8152-34a7-e194f4a55eb7\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/Dh8hfVw9iLneRZ0cmmDf62Y_0i4q4yERzxN9Y9YhnQRxO-u-K2YeL31GIFsTt2ckFmG-6OzBDlxZpMy6_SmcHUWDDMYNyaAR3odpKq3zdOdLNg2WDYHq8t9ubteZtcQRKQtdU0--tugSqRrVU-5kBXnGPOE-D4C-xeR6_6qHu6Wpno8CC2zwP9T4myB14Q\" width=\"150\"></b><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<b id=\"docs-internal-guid-ed1e148d-7fff-8152-34a7-e194f4a55eb7\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/Bk452Rm5zjg5SH0BE9K1EbepXWQZHKlgIus_Qcq2OIp9RZrgvBhmJxv8LsmHiOW-HaJSY7zp8kBtX5-j6G4OuHzxEQYdMMCFywLd5sfDfAQ-YFB0f7yv4jrCAtakZ8dcLhBUi1F29z_VhIN4mifHzgxTpXpVcmQ-ESEWIAE4De3Y5I25Bn5-TpCovll_yA\" width=\"150\"></b></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-ed1e148d-7fff-8152-34a7-e194f4a55eb7\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/Rzfixn6hA4i57anBYAw3XyIoBBWm0ql52y9l_C3i-KuaoNdYYfR9nBkJU6TFwEv1ylGXAwxv81mcPh_qE72lV6vzvSWNHudvoOfFYD-suw0D1awO5N5jDorTIhAfRQ7ZDGuL1PbeQC6T0QPCN0qsoC6wiy6d5U_5c8Icy7MScirnuHeV9ayJ7qA_y41vPA\" width=\"150\"></b><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<b id=\"docs-internal-guid-ed1e148d-7fff-8152-34a7-e194f4a55eb7\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/STf7BY3B0pni-wulwxNYcxX-h1-Xqku_7wf6OF4v53wlb91g8v7-HeXDYmS1tOsTap72_IwbNSi2IsE2C8b0e3TKK7kTKXyEBHdeWicqM9NUEyZbvlcekmG3yc4PY6HR65YMeJ23XUICVEfKb9EYgR-IZvVRE006hbBPNRHHYh4Ct5dSlPgKbbFMpzbkyA\" width=\"150\"></b><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ One New Uniform Collection</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Check out the new Uniforms of the December Update.<br>\nComplete the collection by achieving the specified conditions and earn a reward.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1670302026116\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/53b256ae376a40b0ad6194158eaaef40_1670302026116_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<strong><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Other Improvements and Changes</span></span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. A feature to purchase free and Gold purchase products at once from the Store has been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1670302712534\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/403f222140b346bbb5c6f79efaa417ff_1670302712534_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"434\" id=\"1670302712560\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/642f735327fa4294a976483aa36adcbf_1670302712560_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. When reaching the maximum capacity of Gold, additional Gold acquired&nbsp;<br>\nthrough various Chests from the Store, Inbox, and Craft contents will now be sent to the Inbox.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">3. The Uniform acquisition method can now be checked directly at the Uniform - All Uniforms.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- The acquisition method will not be displayed&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">for purchased Uniforms, Uniforms that are not available, and paid Uniforms.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">4. The occasional issue of the main lobby screen animation being unstable has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Game Error Fixes</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. The occasional issue of the BGM not being played&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">on some devices using the Android 12 OS has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. The issue of the skill cooldown time not being applied normally&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">after using the skills of specific heroes has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">3. The issue of the messages of Agents who are not an Alliance member&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">being shown on the Alliance chat has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">4. The issue of the gender of Captain America not being changed to female&nbsp;<br>\nwhen equipping the Captain America &lt;Secret Wars: 2099&gt; Uniform at Tier-4 has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">5. The issue of the targeting being changed to normal enemies&nbsp;<br>\nwhen using a skill after targeting Surtur at Alliance Battle: Legend has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">6. The issue of the specific pattern of World Boss&nbsp;Legend: Infinity Ultron being&nbsp;<br>\nignored with the Striker effect of Heimdall has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We will return with various content improvements, so please stay tuned.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1670301178952\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/4dae7fd0a86444a288497d1e102e9a8f_1670301178952_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n"
